  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Flood Relief Fund, Himachal Pradesh &amp; Bihar 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">iPartner India seeks support to relieve flood-affected families in Himachal Pradesh and Bihar. Funds for 1,200 families are being raised to help provide the victims with temporary shelters, solar lanterns, food, water, medicine, and fodder. The devastating floods and landslides have caused extensive damage, with collapsed bridges, washed-away markets, and disrupted connectivity. By partnering with compassionate donors, the project aims to provide essential assistance to flood-affected families.</narrative>
  </description>
